{"content":[{"c":["ABINADAB"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Resident of Kiriath-jearim to whose home the ark of God was brought on its return by the Philistines (",{"href":"?bref=1Sam.6.21-7.2","r":"1Sam.6.21-7.2","rawR":"1Sam.6.21-7.2","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Sam.6.21-7.2","value":"1Sam.6.21-7.2"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Sm 6:21–7:2"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Jesse’s second son, and brother of David (",{"href":"?bref=1Sam.16.8","r":"1Sam.16.8","rawR":"1Sam.16.8","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Sam.16.8","value":"1Sam.16.8"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Sm 16:8"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Sam.17.13","r":"1Sam.17.13","rawR":"1Sam.17.13","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Sam.17.13","value":"1Sam.17.13"}],"t":"ref","v":"17:13"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.2.13","r":"1Chr.2.13","rawR":"1Chr.2.13","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.2.13","value":"1Chr.2.13"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 2:13"},"). This Abinadab served in Saul’s army for part of the Philistine war."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["3. KJV form of Ben-abinadab, one of King Solomon’s administrative officers in ",{"href":"?bref=1Kgs.4.11","r":"1Kgs.4.11","rawR":"1Kgs.4.11","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Kgs.4.11","value":"1Kgs.4.11"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Kings 4:11"},". ",{"c":["See"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=BenAbinadab_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"BenAbinadab_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"BenAbinadab_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Ben-abinadab"},"."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["4. One of Saul’s sons (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.8.33","r":"1Chr.8.33","rawR":"1Chr.8.33","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.8.33","value":"1Chr.8.33"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 8:33"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.10.2","r":"1Chr.10.2","rawR":"1Chr.10.2","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.10.2","value":"1Chr.10.2"}],"t":"ref","v":"10:2"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Abinadab","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dc